{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 DEBUG (Analysis)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab D - Define the problem\par}
