{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab E - Empathize with the other person\u8217's problem\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab A - Ask questions to understand\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab T - Take a break if needed\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab H - Hold back from reacting\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab E - Express yourself calmly\sa180\par}
